## Build

Children are referenced by type; they must be on the classpath when you compile.

```bash
# If children are source-local (Maven-ish layout):
javac -cp {{classpath_jar}} \
      -d build \
      {{class_name}}.java {{child_source_paths_space_separated}}

# If children are already compiled:
javac -cp {{classpath_jar}}:{{children_classpath}} {{class_name}}.java
```

Default Closure-DEVS JAR path (override with your own if needed):
`~/.m2/repository/com/ms4systems/Closure-DEVS/1.0.0/Closure-DEVS-1.0.0.jar`

